Miss Lew-
&gt;&gt; Do you believe him?

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:08.290
Even if you didn't know,
if you didn't know that he was lying,

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.770
you would be able to tell
that something's off.

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:14.600
There's a difference between I did not and
